PROGRAM checkout scenarios

USE "./rules.gwt"

SCENARIO checkout examples
GIVEN customer is Customer
  member: <member>

GIVEN cart is Cart
  items: <items>
  subtotal: 0
  shipping: 0
  discount: 0
  total: 0

REQUEST checkout cart

THEN cart.total == <total>
AND cart.shipping == <shipping>
AND cart.discount == <discount>
AND order.status == "priced"

EXAMPLES
  | member | items        | total | shipping | discount |
  | true   | [20, 35, 45] | 90.0  | 0        | 10.0     |
  | false  | [20, 35]     | 63    | 8        | 0        |
